Let Moonlight's bitrate slider reach 500 Mbps without the "Unlock bitrate" checkbox.

Moonlight caps the video bitrate slider at 150 Mbps unless StreamingPreferences.
unlockBitrate is true.  That gate is removed from the slider itself, and the
preference now defaults to true, so a freshly built client can select the 500 Mbps
ceiling that Sunshine allows (max_bitrate = 500000 kbps in sunshine.conf).

Two files change:
  app/gui/SettingsView.qml                 slider .to: 500000 (was a ternary)
  app/settings/streamingpreferences.cpp    unlockBitrate defaults to true

Apply from the root of a moonlight-qt checkout:
  git apply moonlight-500mbps.patch
  # or: patch -p1 < moonlight-500mbps.patch

This diff is written against LF sources.  On a Windows box with core.autocrlf=true
a plain "git apply" rewrites the whole file to CRLF, which shows up as a 1821-line
change instead of a 5-line one.  Disable the conversion if that matters:
  git -c core.autocrlf=false apply moonlight-500mbps.patch

Then rebuild.  The QML is compiled into qml_qmlcache.qrc inside Moonlight.exe, so
copying a .qml file over an existing build has no effect - the client has to be
recompiled for the slider limit to move.

diff --git a/app/gui/SettingsView.qml b/app/gui/SettingsView.qml
--- a/app/gui/SettingsView.qml
+++ b/app/gui/SettingsView.qml
@@ -693,7 +693,12 @@
 
                         stepSize: 500
                         from : 500
-                        to: StreamingPreferences.unlockBitrate ? 500000 : 150000
+                        // LUXSTREAM: podignuto s 150000 na 500000 bez uvjeta.
+                        // Original je vrsio to: unlockBitrate ? 500000 : 150000,
+                        // pa je klizac stao na 150 Mbps dok se ne oznaci
+                        // "Unlock bitrate". 500 Mbps je i Sunshineov strop
+                        // (max_bitrate = 500000), pa ovo dvoje sada odgovara.
+                        to: 500000
 
                         snapMode: "SnapOnRelease"
                         width: Math.min(bitrateDesc.implicitWidth, parent.width - (resetBitrateButton.visible ? resetBitrateButton.width + parent.spacing : 0))
diff --git a/app/settings/streamingpreferences.cpp b/app/settings/streamingpreferences.cpp
--- a/app/settings/streamingpreferences.cpp
+++ b/app/settings/streamingpreferences.cpp
@@ -127,7 +127,10 @@
     fps = settings.value(SER_FPS, 60).toInt();
     enableYUV444 = settings.value(SER_YUV444, false).toBool();
     bitrateKbps = settings.value(SER_BITRATE, getDefaultBitrate(width, height, fps, enableYUV444)).toInt();
-    unlockBitrate = settings.value(SER_UNLOCK_BITRATE, false).toBool();
+    // LUXSTREAM: zadano je true (original false). Klizac je ionako otkljucan na
+    // 500000, pa bi false ovdje znacilo samo da kukica stoji neoznacena dok
+    // ponasanje izgleda kao da je oznacena - zbunjujuce.
+    unlockBitrate = settings.value(SER_UNLOCK_BITRATE, true).toBool();
     autoAdjustBitrate = settings.value(SER_AUTOADJUSTBITRATE, true).toBool();
     enableVsync = settings.value(SER_VSYNC, true).toBool();
     gameOptimizations = settings.value(SER_GAMEOPTS, true).toBool();
